&lt;
&lt;p>&lt;span>&lt;/span>&lt;span data-contrast="auto">&lt;/span>&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">Role Summary&lt;/span>&lt;span data-ccp-props="{"134245418":true,"134245529":true,"335559738":280,"335559739":120}"> &lt;/span>&lt;
&lt;
&lt;
&lt;p>&lt;span>We are looking for an experienced &lt;/span>&lt;span data-contrast="auto">&lt;span>Senior GCP DevOps &amp; &lt;/span>&lt;span>LLMOps&lt;/span>&lt;span> Engineer&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span data-contrast="auto">&lt;span> to architect, deploy, and &lt;/span>&lt;span>maintain&lt;/span>&lt;span> robust infrastructure supporting enterprise-scale Large Language Model (LLM) and Generative AI applications. In this role, you will bridge the gap between traditional DevOps, platform engineering, and modern machine learning operations.&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span data-ccp-props="{"335559739":160}"> &lt;/span>&lt;
&lt;
&lt;
&lt;p>&lt;span>You will lead the automation of Google Cloud Platform (GCP) environments using &lt;/span>&lt;span>Terraform&lt;/span>&lt;span>, design resilient CI/CD pipelines, and implement production-grade &lt;/span>&lt;span data-contrast="auto">&lt;span>LLMOps&lt;/span>&lt;span> architectures&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span>—including model serving, inference routing, vector database orchestration, evaluation pipelines, and GPU/TPU resource optimization.&lt;/span>&lt;span data-ccp-props="{"335559739":160}"> &lt;/span>&lt;
&lt;
&lt;
&lt;p aria-level="2">&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle="heading 2">Key Responsibilities&lt;/span>&lt;span data-ccp-props="{"134245418":true,"134245529":true,"335559738":280,"335559739":120}"> &lt;/span>&lt;
&lt;
&lt;
